cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MIB, please cite it as below."
title: "MIB — Memory Intelligence Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark for measuring how effectively an intelligent system uses the past to
  improve future cognition and behavior. MIB does not measure how much an agent
  remembers; it measures whether the right part of the past changed the future in the
  right way, using paired causal interventions over memory.
type: software
authors:
